        "note": "fake leg (CI run 44992641994): the step's call returned (exit 1, tunnel 403) but its window holds no pre line: stop.block, ask.raised, ask.answered only; where the pre line was written was not read"
      },
        {
          "issue": 6674,
          "leg": "fake",
          "step": 1,
          "assertion": "require[0]",
          "observed": 3,
          "note": "fake leg (CI run 44962030981): three ask.raised in this step's window: the double raise the global check names (event 28) and one more raised in it, not attributed"
        },
        {
          "issue": 6674,
          "leg": "fake",
          "check": "one_ask_one_raise",
          "refusal": "step 1",
          "note": "fake leg (CI run 44962030981): a held ask is raised twice with nothing between (event 28, inside this step's window)"
        },
        {
          "issue": 7353,
          "leg": "fake",
          "step": 1,
          "assertion": "forbid[0]",
          "observed": "no hook.stop",
          "note": "fake leg (CI run 44962030981): no hook.stop in this step's window, so `next_prompt` has no anchor"
        },
        {
          "issue": 7354,
          "leg": "fake",
          "step": 1,
          "assertion": "transcript[0]",
          "observed": false,
          "note": "fake leg (CI run 44962030981): the Kept-blocked sentence is not in this step's chat lines: it is in the next step's context"
        },
        {
          "issue": 6674,
          "leg": "live",
          "step": 1,
          "assertion": "require[0]",
          "observed": 2,
          "note": "chat 682 (§8): every held ask wrote ask.raised twice; the rest of the cell passed"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
